# Requests for the VS Code "REST Client" extension (humao.rest-client):
# click "Send Request" above each request.
# `make run` uses the token "dev"; `docker compose up` uses GANTRY_TOKEN from .env.

@host = http://127.0.0.1:7070
@token = dev

### Health (public, no token)
GET {{host}}/healthz

### Version
GET {{host}}/api/v1/version
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### List stacks
GET {{host}}/api/v1/stacks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Stack details
GET {{host}}/api/v1/stacks/whoami
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Unknown stack → 404
GET {{host}}/api/v1/stacks/does-not-exist
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Invalid name → 400
GET {{host}}/api/v1/stacks/Bad.Name
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Without token → 401
GET {{host}}/api/v1/stacks
